    Matched                            35,228  
    -----------------------------------------

.         merge 1:1 pid syear using "$IN/pl.dta", nogen keepusing(plh0004 plb01
> 76_h plb0585 plb0584 plb0517 plc0177 plc0178 plh0308_v2 pld0133 plc0177 plc01
